*.png
# Rendering assets ARE tracked and must ship in the Railway build context —
# `railway up` respects .gitignore, so a global *.png strip drops the court/
# editorial/mark PNGs from the image and every card render then 500s with
# FileNotFoundError. Whitelist that directory explicitly.
!src/feb_score/infrastructure/rendering/assets/*.png
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-*
